{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world torn apart by ancient deities, where their struggle for power leaves a lasting mark on the mortal realm. Your mission: defend the land against relentless enemies using the might of magical towers and your own combat prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic tale of a divine conflict </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruling pantheon of new gods must face the chaotic powers of the awakened ancient deities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/8a0159acc5b9020d51314ff01d10e374.poster.avif?t=1773017144\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/8a0159acc5b9020d51314ff01d10e374.webm?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/8a0159acc5b9020d51314ff01d10e374.mp4?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wild mix of <strong>action</strong> and <strong>classic Tower Defense </strong>formula</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends the strategic depth of the Tower Defense genre with fast-paced action, letting you both plan your defenses and directly influence the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/2137defabdeaa02dd54aaa1996db220d.poster.avif?t=1773017144\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/2137defabdeaa02dd54aaa1996db220d.webm?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/2137defabdeaa02dd54aaa1996db220d.mp4?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse content and endless replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful combinations of towers, face off against enemies with unique abilities, unleash battle-altering spells, and explore a variety of biomes \u2013 each with their own rules and challenges. No two battles ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/e9f70460a195a6da16d237bafd6e49c0.poster.avif?t=1773017144\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/e9f70460a195a6da16d237bafd6e49c0.webm?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/e9f70460a195a6da16d237bafd6e49c0.mp4?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hold the line against endless hordes and uncover the true nature of the divine conflict?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069220?t=1773017144","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/bb647cd4b4a9d40b1632ea975a9ba173c74d574d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773017144","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/9342324d3bc1af039768bdea48900350a22ad569/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773017144","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/9342324d3bc1af039768bdea48900350a22ad569/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773017144","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world torn apart by ancient deities, where their struggle for power leaves a lasting mark on the mortal realm. Your mission: defend the land against relentless enemies using the might of magical towers and your own combat prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic tale of a divine conflict </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ruling pantheon of new gods must face the chaotic powers of the awakened ancient deities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/8a0159acc5b9020d51314ff01d10e374.poster.avif?t=1773017144\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/8a0159acc5b9020d51314ff01d10e374.webm?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/8a0159acc5b9020d51314ff01d10e374.mp4?t=1773017144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wild mix of <strong>action</strong> and <strong>classic Tower Defense </strong>formula</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends the strategic depth of the Tower Defense genre with fast-paced action, letting you both plan your defenses and directly influence the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069220/extras/2137defabdeaa02